+# Node `PowerTransport.v1` — HYPOTHETICAL, experiment only
+
+Disposable worktree, never pushed. It measures what registering a program-verified numerical
+provider as its own node costs and buys (PV_NODE_SPLIT study, layout B).
+
+The conclusion is the output contract of the power-form Table 4 transport: from the network's QRH
+`θ` frontier and FKS2's Table 4 anchor, a decaying `π` bound on `x ≥ e^330`. It is stated with
+Vocabulary only (`HasPowerLogBound`, `Eπ`); no program, source text or AST appears here.
+-/
+
+namespace PowerTransport.v1
+
+open IEANTN Real
+
+/-- **Power-form `π` bound from the QRH `θ` frontier.** For every `x ≥ e^330`,
+`Eπ(x) ≤ 0.013156·x^{-1/8}`. -/
+def pi_power_network : Prop :=
+  HasPowerLogBound Eπ 0.013156 0 (7 / 8) (exp 330)
+
+end PowerTransport.v1
